{
  "description": "Shared vectors of the age norms lookup, run against the shipped file code/api/data/age-norms.json: read by code/web/src/ageNorms/ageNorms.test.ts and by code/api/tests/Lotties.Domain.Tests/AgeNorms/AgeNormsVectorTests.cs (linked file). A lookup finds the band of `metric` that holds `ageDays` (completed days since birth) for `population`, else for 'all'; `expected` is null when no band holds the age. `prior` says whether the norm may replace a default (not low confidence, not needsReview).",
  "lookups": [
